{
  "id": "RAW_ae9c545792",
  "title": "Together AI 发布 Together Compiler：智能体让推理速度最高提升 2.6x",
  "url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/05/together-ai-together-compiler-continual-compilation-ai-inference/",
  "date": "2026-11-05 16:03:01",
  "author": "Asif Razzaq",
  "siteName": "MarkTechPost",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_top  tdi_78 td_block_template_1\">\n   <!-- MTP Preferred Source badge : DESKTOP (plain link, no script; hidden below 640px) -->\n   <div id=\"mtp-pref-desk\">\n    <a class=\"mtp-pref-btn\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=marktechpost.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Add Marktechpost as a preferred source on Google\"><img src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/googleg/1x/googleg_standard_color_128dp.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"mtp-pref-txt\"><span style=\"display:block!important\">Add as a preferred</span><span style=\"display:block!important\">source on Google</span></span></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Together AI has introduced <a href=\"https://www.together.ai/blog/together-compiler-continual-compilation-for-ai-inference\">Together Compiler</a> (TKCC), an agent-driven system that keeps re-optimizing inference as production traffic changes. Together Compiler already runs on several of Together’s serverless endpoints. The core claim for developers: an engine tuned once goes stale, so tuning should never stop.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-tl-dr\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li><strong>System:</strong> It is an optimization system, tested on Kimi K3, GLM 5.3, MiniMax M3.1 Flash, DeepSeek v4.1 Flash and Llama 1B.</li>\n   <li><strong>Runs on:</strong> NVIDIA B200, B300, GB300, H100, AMD MI355X and AWS Trainium2. Each run used at most 2 nodes per model.</li>\n   <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Up to 2.6x higher TPS than the best published InferenceX configurations, in under 24 hours per setting.</li>\n   <li><strong>Best:</strong> 1,111 P90 TPS per user on MiniMax M3.1 Flash (B200, batch size 1), 1.8x over the 633 TPS baseline.</li>\n   <li><strong>Worst:</strong> GLM 5.3 on MI355X moved only from 463 to 480 TPS (about 4%).</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h2 id=\"h-what-is-together-compiler\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Together Compiler?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Together Compiler is a continual compilation loop from Together AI that uses coding agents to rewrite a model’s forward pass. It takes a server launch command, a traffic profile and a hardware configuration. Agents propose faster forward passes, and a persistent engine measures each one. The winning code ships into the serving engine. When traffic drifts, the loop runs again.</p>\n  <div class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_inline  tdi_77 td_block_template_1\">\n   <!-- omni_parse_bench in-article 728x90 (strip-728x90) | paste into a Custom HTML block | fills the article column and scales down on narrow screens. -->\n   <div id=\"op728x90\">\n    <a class=\"o\" href=\"https://aicampaign.live/omnipar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener\"><span class=\"paper\"><i class=\"p-h\"></i><i class=\"p-l l1\"></i><i class=\"p-l l2\"></i><i class=\"p-l l3\"></i><i class=\"p-tb\"></i><i class=\"p-fg\"></i><i class=\"p-l l4\"></i><i class=\"p-l l5\"></i><i class=\"p-l l6\"></i><b class=\"bx bt\"><em>TEXT</em></b><b class=\"bx bb\"><em>TABLE</em></b><b class=\"bx bl\"><em>LAYOUT</em></b><i class=\"scan\"></i></span><span class=\"col m\"><span class=\"head\">Is your PDF parser <em>actually getting it right?</em></span><span class=\"sub\"><code>omni_parse_bench</code> · scores text, tables &amp; layout · open source</span></span><span class=\"cta\"><span class=\"ct\">Star on GitHub</span><b class=\"ar\">→</b></span><span class=\"tag\">Sponsored</span></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <h2 id=\"h-why-does-inference-need-continual-compilation\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why does inference need continual compilation?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Together AI team reports that its traffic shape never sits still. Prompt lengths in one country ran about <a href=\"http://www.together.ai/together-compiler-paper\">97K tokens versus 70K</a> elsewhere. One customer’s P90 input length grew from 18K to 33K tokens in 3 days.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kernels tuned on random data can also mislead. Random inputs activated 13 to 38% more MoE experts than real traffic. One agent-written top-k kernel took 20 µs on random data. On real data at 70K context, it took up to 62 ms.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-the-persistent-engine-work\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does the persistent engine work?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Most agent loops restart vLLM, SGLang or TensorRT-LLM for every experiment. The research team measures 761 seconds of cold startup for MiniMax M3.1 Flash on TensorRT-LLM. Together Compiler starts the engine once. Agents submit a candidate forward pass over RPC. The server swaps the forward function pointer and re-captures CUDA graphs.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Two measurement tiers balance speed and fidelity. A fast tier serves 12 layers for quick screening. A slow tier serves 60 layers to confirm gains on real distributions. Two tiers tested 8.1x more candidates than one slow tier (1,354 vs 168). They also found a solution 7.2% faster. Together AI team reports 252x higher agent experiment throughput than an engine-restart baseline.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-it-choose-a-parallelism-layout\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does it choose a parallelism layout?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A cost model ranks tensor, expert, data and context parallel layouts before agents start. It mixes spec-sheet numbers, microbenchmarks and measured forward passes. It also uses measured MoE expert imbalance and uneven request lengths. On Kimi K3, it found a production layout with up to 24% higher TPS.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-what-did-agents-need-from-human-experts\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What did agents need from human experts?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An expert-curated knowledge base produced 25 to 31% lower speedup after 12 hours. Naive agents told to make the forward pass “as fast as possible” beat expert strategies. The ensemble scores were 6.2x versus 4.9x after 10 trials. Custom logging structures ate up to 43% of tool calls. Together AI now gives agents raw engine source code, not an intermediate representation.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-benchmarks-how-fast-is-together-compiler\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benchmarks: how fast is Together Compiler?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On <a href=\"https://inferencex.semianalysis.com/inference\">SemiAnalysis InferenceX</a>‘s AgentX workload, Together Compiler beat the best open configurations by up to 2.6x TPS. Each setting ran under 24 hours on at most 2 nodes.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Batch size 1, P90 TPS per user (Together Compiler vs InferenceX best, self-reported):</strong></p>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>MiniMax M3.1 Flash (B200): 1,111 vs 633</li>\n   <li>DeepSeek v4.1 Flash (GB300): 1,205 vs 943</li>\n   <li>GLM 5.3 (B200): 417 vs 329</li>\n   <li>Kimi K3 (GB300): 450 vs 423</li>\n   <li>GLM 5.3 (MI355X): 480 vs 463</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For MiniMax, the cost model picked TP8 over the baseline’s TP4. That halves each GPU’s weight traffic in memory-bound decode.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On Llama 1B at batch size 1, it beat <a href=\"https://github.com/HazyResearch/Megakernels\">Hazy Research megakernels</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/mirage-project/mirage\">Mirage</a> and CUDA-graph baselines by up to 1.7x. Beyond LLMs, it sped up 8 scientific models by 1.5x to 6.4x with bit-exact outputs. Claude Code with /goal reached 1.2x to 4.4x and failed on AIFS-ENS 2.0.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <iframe class=\"lazyload\" id=\"tkcc-frame\" srcdoc=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;\n&lt;title&gt;Together Compiler Explainer&lt;/title&gt;\n&lt;link href=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap&quot; rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot;&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\nhtml,body{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;background:transparent!important}\n#tkcc-x{--bg:#151630;--card:#1d1f42;--line:#2e3163;--tx:#eef0ff;--mut:#a3a8d6;--blue:#5b7cff;--pink:#ff4f8b;--orange:#ff9147;--mtp:#76B900;\nfont-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif!important;max-width:880px;margin:0 auto!important;background:var(--bg)!important;color:var(--tx)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 22px 14px;box-sizing:border-box}\n#tkcc-x *{box-sizing:border-box}\n#tkcc-x p:empty,#tkcc-x hr,#tkcc-x del,#tkcc-x s{display:none!important}\n#tkcc-x .tag{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut)!important;font-weight:600}\n#tkcc-x .dots i{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:3px}\n#tkcc-x h3{margin:8px 0 4px!important;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--tx)!important;line-height:1.25}\n#tkcc-x .sub{color:var(--mut)!important;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 14px!important}\n#tkcc-x .tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}\n#tkcc-x .tab{background:transparent!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;color:var(--mut)!important;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}\n#tkcc-x .tab:hover{color:var(--tx)!important;border-color:var(--blue)!important}\n#tkcc-x .tab.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--pink))!important;color:#fff!important;border-color:transparent!important}\n#tkcc-x .panel{display:none;animation:tkf .35s ease}\n#tkcc-x .panel.on{display:block}\n@keyframes tkf{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n#tkcc-x .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}\n#tkcc-x .node{background:var(--card)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--mut)!important;transition:all .3s;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n#tkcc-x .node b{display:block;color:var(--tx)!important;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px}\n#tkcc-x .node .n{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--orange)!important}\n#tkcc-x .node.on{border-color:var(--pink)!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(255,79,139,.25),0 8px 22px rgba(91,124,255,.25);transform:translateY(-3px)}\n#tkcc-x .detail{background:var(--card)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;min-height:86px;color:var(--tx)!important}\n#tkcc-x .detail em{color:var(--orange)!important;font-style:normal;font-weight:700}\n#tkcc-x .ctrl{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;align-items:center}\n#tkcc-x .btn{background:var(--blue)!important;color:#fff!important;border:0!important;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}\n#tkcc-x .btn.ghost{background:transparent!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;color:var(--mut)!important}\n#tkcc-x .prog{flex:1;height:4px;background:var(--line)!important;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}\n#tkcc-x .prog i{display:block;height:100%;width:20%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--pink),var(--orange))!important;transition:width .4s}\n#tkcc-x .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:9px 0;font-size:13px}\n#tkcc-x .row .lb{width:190px;color:var(--mut)!important;flex-shrink:0}\n#tkcc-x .track{flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)!important;border-radius:6px;height:26px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n#tkcc-x .bar{height:100%;width:0;border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;padding-right:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;color:#fff!important;transition:width 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);white-space:nowrap}\n#tkcc-x .b1{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--pink))!important}\n#tkcc-x .b0{background:#3a3d6e!important;color:var(--mut)!important}\n#tkcc-x .b2{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--pink),var(--orange))!important}\n#tkcc-x .vv{width:52px;text-align:right;font-weight:800;color:var(--tx)!important;flex-shrink:0}\n#tkcc-x .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start}\n#tkcc-x .stat{background:var(--card)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}\n#tkcc-x .stat .v{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--pink));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent!important}\n#tkcc-x .stat .k{font-size:12px;color:var(--mut)!important;margin-top:2px}\n#tkcc-x .sel{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#tkcc-x .legend{font-size:12px;color:var(--mut)!important;margin:4px 0 8px}\n#tkcc-x .legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin:0 4px 0 10px;vertical-align:-1px}\n#tkcc-x .card{background:var(--card)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s}\n#tkcc-x .card:hover{border-color:var(--blue)!important}\n#tkcc-x .card h4{margin:0!important;font-size:14px;color:var(--tx)!important;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}\n#tkcc-x .card .more{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .35s;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)!important;line-height:1.5}\n#tkcc-x .card.open .more{max-height:160px;margin-top:8px}\n#tkcc-x .card .big{color:var(--orange)!important;font-weight:800}\n#tkcc-x .note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mut)!important;margin-top:10px}\n#tkcc-x .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:14px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)!important;color:var(--mut)!important}\n#tkcc-x .foot .mtp{color:var(--mtp)!important;font-weight:700}\n#tkcc-x .pulse{animation:tkp 1.6s infinite}\n@keyframes tkp{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,79,139,.4)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(255,79,139,0)}}\n@media (max-width:640px){#tkcc-x{padding:16px 14px 12px}#tkcc-x h3{font-size:18px}#tkcc-x .flow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}#tkcc-x .row .lb{width:110px;font-size:11.5px}#tkcc-x .vv{width:52px;text-align:right;font-weight:800;color:var(--tx)!important;flex-shrink:0}\n#tkcc-x .grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;\n&lt;div id=&quot;tkcc-x&quot;&gt;\n&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dots&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background:#5b7cff&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background:#ff4f8b&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background:#ff9147&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Together AI · Research · Nov 4, 2026&lt;/span&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;How Together Compiler keeps inference fast as traffic shifts&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;sub&quot;&gt;Agents rewrite the forward pass. A persistent engine measures it. The loop repeats when traffic drifts.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;tabs&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=&quot;tab on&quot; data-t=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The loop&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Persistent engine&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Benchmarks&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Bitter lessons&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;panel on&quot; data-p=&quot;0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;flow&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;node on&quot; data-s=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Traffic drifts&lt;/b&gt;prompt lengths shift&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; data-s=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cost model&lt;/b&gt;ranks TP / EP / DP / CP&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; data-s=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;03&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Parallel agents&lt;/b&gt;rewrite forward pass&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; data-s=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;2-tier engine&lt;/b&gt;hot reload + measure&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; data-s=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deploy&lt;/b&gt;best code ships&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;detail&quot; id=&quot;tk-d&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;ctrl&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;btn ghost&quot; id=&quot;tk-prev&quot;&gt;← Back&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;btn&quot; id=&quot;tk-next&quot;&gt;Next step →&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;prog&quot;&gt;&lt;i id=&quot;tk-pg&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;btn ghost&quot; id=&quot;tk-auto&quot;&gt;▶ Auto-play&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; data-p=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;legend&quot;&gt;Time before a candidate can be measured (MiniMax M3.1 Flash, TensorRT-LLM, paper Table 1)&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;Cold engine start (status quo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;track&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bar b0&quot; data-w=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vv&quot;&gt;761 s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;Hot reload, slow tier (60 layers)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;track&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bar b2&quot; data-w=&quot;5.9&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vv&quot;&gt;45 s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;Hot reload, fast tier (12 layers)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;track&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bar b1&quot; data-w=&quot;2.2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vv&quot;&gt;17 s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;grid2&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:12px&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;252x&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;more agent experiments than an engine-restart baseline&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;8.1x&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;more candidates with 2 tiers vs 1 slow tier (1,354 vs 168)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;7.2%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;faster final solution from the two-tier setup&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;11x&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;lower idle time per agent&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; data-p=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;sel&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;tab on&quot; data-m=&quot;p90&quot;&gt;P90 TPS per user, batch size 1&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-m=&quot;llama&quot;&gt;Llama 1B, batch size 1 (B200)&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;legend&quot; id=&quot;tk-lg&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div id=&quot;tk-bars&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Self-reported by Together AI. InferenceX baselines as of Oct 27, 2026. Under 24 hours, at most 2 nodes per model.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; data-p=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;grid2&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Knowledge base &lt;span&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;more&quot;&gt;An expert-curated knowledge base gave &lt;span class=&quot;big&quot;&gt;25 to 31%&lt;/span&gt; lower speedup after 12 hours. Agents wasted time searching it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Expert strategies &lt;span&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;more&quot;&gt;Naive agents (&quot;make it as fast as possible&quot;) beat expert-assigned strategies: &lt;span class=&quot;big&quot;&gt;6.2x vs 4.9x&lt;/span&gt; after 10 trials.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Custom logging &lt;span&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;more&quot;&gt;Human-designed research logs consumed up to &lt;span class=&quot;big&quot;&gt;43%&lt;/span&gt; of tool calls per trial.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;No intermediate representation &lt;span&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;more&quot;&gt;Raw engine source let agents rewrite Kimi K3's MLA metadata kernel for a &lt;span class=&quot;big&quot;&gt;1.7 to 2.5x&lt;/span&gt; kernel speedup.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Megakernels on GPUs &lt;span&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;more&quot;&gt;Rarely paid off: only &lt;span class=&quot;big&quot;&gt;0.22%&lt;/span&gt; faster on AMD GLM 5.3. Trainium2 was the exception.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Still the bottleneck &lt;span&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;more&quot;&gt;Agents spend over &lt;span class=&quot;big&quot;&gt;50%&lt;/span&gt; of their time waiting on measurement gates.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;foot&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sources: Together AI paper and blog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mtp&quot;&gt;© Marktechpost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\n(function(){\nvar R=document.getElementById('tkcc-x');\nfunction rs(){try{parent.postMessage({tkccH:R.offsetHeight+40},'*')}catch(e){}}\nvar steps=[\n'Together reports traffic keeps changing. One customer\\'s P90 input length grew from &lt;em&gt;18K to 33K&lt;/em&gt; tokens in 3 days. Random test data activates &lt;em&gt;13 to 38%&lt;/em&gt; more MoE experts than real traffic.',\n'A cost model ranks parallelism layouts before agents start. It blends spec sheets, microbenchmarks and measured passes. On Kimi K3 it found a layout with up to &lt;em&gt;24%&lt;/em&gt; higher TPS.',\n'Multiple coding agents work in parallel and share findings on a message board. High-frequency communication made search &lt;em&gt;4.7x&lt;/em&gt; faster in ablations.',\n'The engine starts once. Each candidate is hot-reloaded: swap the forward pointer, re-capture CUDA graphs. A &lt;em&gt;12-layer&lt;/em&gt; fast tier screens; a &lt;em&gt;60-layer&lt;/em&gt; slow tier confirms.',\n'After the budget runs out, verification tests check correctness and KV cache safety. The best config and forward pass go to production. Result: up to &lt;em&gt;2.6x&lt;/em&gt; TPS over InferenceX best.'];\nvar cur=0,auto=null,nodes=R.querySelectorAll('.node');\nfunction show(i){cur=(i+5)%5;nodes.forEach(function(n,k){n.classList.toggle('on',k===cur)});R.querySelector('#tk-d').innerHTML=steps[cur];R.querySelector('#tk-pg').style.width=((cur+1)*20)+'%';}\nnodes.forEach(function(n,k){n.onclick=function(){show(k)}});\nR.querySelector('#tk-next').onclick=function(){show(cur+1)};\nR.querySelector('#tk-prev').onclick=function(){show(cur-1)};\nR.querySelector('#tk-auto').onclick=function(){var b=this;if(auto){clearInterval(auto);auto=null;b.textContent='▶ Auto-play';b.classList.remove('pulse')}else{auto=setInterval(function(){show(cur+1)},2600);b.textContent='❚❚ Pause';b.classList.add('pulse')}};\nshow(0);\nvar data={p90:{lg:'&lt;i style=&quot;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5b7cff,#ff4f8b)&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Together Compiler&lt;i style=&quot;background:#3a3d6e&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;InferenceX best',max:1300,rows:[['MiniMax M3.1 Flash · B200',1111,633],['DeepSeek v4.1 Flash · GB300',1205,943],['DeepSeek v4.1 Flash · B200',813,671],['Kimi K3 · GB300',450,423],['GLM 5.3 · MI355X',480,463],['GLM 5.3 · B200',417,329]]},\nllama:{lg:'&lt;i style=&quot;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5b7cff,#ff4f8b)&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Together Compiler&lt;i style=&quot;background:#3a3d6e&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Best baseline per length (megakernel or CUDA graph, output tokens/s)',max:2300,rows:[['OSL 256',2118,1649],['OSL 1,024',2011,1569],['OSL 4,096',1945,1414],['OSL 16,384',1871,1123],['OSL 65,536',1482,892]]}};\nfunction bars(m){var d=data[m],h='';d.rows.forEach(function(r){h+='&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;'+r[0]+'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex:1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;track&quot; style=&quot;height:20px;margin-bottom:3px&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bar b1&quot; data-w=&quot;'+(r[1]/d.max*100)+'&quot;&gt;'+r[1].toLocaleString()+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;track&quot; style=&quot;height:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bar b0&quot; data-w=&quot;'+(r[2]/d.max*100)+'&quot;&gt;'+r[2].toLocaleString()+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;'});\nR.querySelector('#tk-lg').innerHTML=d.lg;R.querySelector('#tk-bars').innerHTML=h;grow(R.querySelector('#tk-bars'));}\nfunction grow(el){var b=el.querySelectorAll('.bar');b.forEach(function(x){x.style.width='0'});setTimeout(function(){b.forEach(function(x){x.style.width=(x.textContent?Math.max(x.dataset.w,9):Math.max(x.dataset.w,1.5))+'%'})},60);setTimeout(rs,1200);}\nR.querySelectorAll('[data-m]').forEach(function(t){t.onclick=function(){R.querySelectorAll('[data-m]').forEach(function(z){z.classList.remove('on')});t.classList.add('on');bars(t.dataset.m)}});\nR.querySelectorAll('.tabs .tab').forEach(function(t){t.onclick=function(){var i=t.dataset.t;R.querySelectorAll('.tabs .tab').forEach(function(z){z.classList.toggle('on',z===t)});R.querySelectorAll('.panel').forEach(function(p){p.classList.toggle('on',p.dataset.p===i)});if(i==='1')grow(R.querySelector('[data-p=&quot;1&quot;]'));if(i==='2')bars(R.querySelector('[data-m].on').dataset.m);rs();}});\nR.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(function(c){c.onclick=function(){c.classList.toggle('open');c.querySelector('h4 span').textContent=c.classList.contains('open')?'−':'+';setTimeout(rs,400)}});\nwindow.addEventListener('load',rs);window.addEventListener('resize',rs);setTimeout(rs,300);\n})();\n&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;\n\" loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Together Compiler interactive explainer\"></iframe>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-it-compare-with-other-agentic-optimization-systems\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does it compare with other agentic optimization systems?</strong></h2>\n  <figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\n   <table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Metrics</th>\n      <th><strong>Together Compiler</strong></th>\n      <th><strong>Cursor + NVIDIA multi-agent</strong></th>\n      <th><strong>AMD GEAK</strong></th>\n      <th><strong>Apple RSI-Inference Bench</strong></th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Type</td>\n      <td>Production optimization loop</td>\n      <td>Multi-agent kernel optimizer</td>\n      <td>Triton kernel agent framework</td>\n      <td>Benchmark for coding agents</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Scope</td>\n      <td>Full forward pass inside the serving engine</td>\n      <td>235 standalone CUDA kernels (SOL-ExecBench)</td>\n      <td>Individual Triton kernels</td>\n      <td>37 tasks editing vLLM or SGLang</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Measurement</td>\n      <td>Persistent engine, hot reload, 2 tiers, real traffic</td>\n      <td>SOL-ExecBench on 27 B200 GPUs</td>\n      <td>TritonBench-revised and ROCm benchmark</td>\n      <td>Verifier builds the engine and serves the model</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Hardware</td>\n      <td>B200, B300, GB300, H100, MI355X, Trainium2</td>\n      <td>B200</td>\n      <td>AMD Instinct MI300X</td>\n      <td>H100, B200</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Main result</td>\n      <td>Up to 2.6x TPS vs InferenceX best</td>\n      <td>1.38x geomean, wins on 149 of 235</td>\n      <td>Up to 2.59x speedup, up to 63.33% correctness</td>\n      <td>Scores agents; no single system result</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Time budget</td>\n      <td>Under 24 hours per setting</td>\n      <td>3 weeks</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td>Up to 8 hours per task</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Availability</td>\n      <td>Limited beta for Together customers</td>\n      <td>Results in public repo</td>\n      <td>Open source</td>\n      <td>Apple Sample Code License</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </figure>\n  <h2 id=\"h-key-takeaways\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>Together Compiler re-optimizes inference continually as traffic shifts.</li>\n   <li>Persistent engines with hot reload deliver 252x more agent experiments.</li>\n   <li>Up to 2.6x TPS over the best InferenceX configs within 24 hours.</li>\n   <li>Naive agents beat expert knowledge bases and curated strategies.</li>\n   <li>Self-reported; gains range from about 4% to 2.6x across settings.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check out the<strong> <a href=\"http://www.together.ai/together-compiler-paper\">paper</a></strong>, the <a href=\"https://www.together.ai/blog/together-compiler-continual-compilation-for-ai-inference\"><strong>Together Compiler blog</strong></a> and the <a href=\"https://www.together.ai/blog/polymorphic-inference\"><strong>Polymorphic Inference post</strong></a>. Also,&nbsp;feel free to follow us on&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=marktechpost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Twitter</mark></a></strong>&nbsp;and don’t forget to join our&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/machinelearningnews/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">150k+ML SubReddit</a></strong>&nbsp;and Subscribe to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/f5e63dd4-5653-4f09-83e2-321a8b1ba526?email={{email}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">our Newsletter</a></strong>. Wait! are you on telegram?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://t.me/machinelearningresearchnews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">now you can join us on telegram as well.</a></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Need to partner with us for promoting your GitHub Repo OR Hugging Face Page OR Product Release OR Webinar etc.?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://promotions.marktechpost.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Connect with us</mark></a></strong></p>\n  <!-- MOLONGUI AUTHORSHIP PLUGIN 5.3.2 -->\n  <!-- https://www.molongui.com/wordpress-plugin-post-authors -->\n  <div class=\"m-a-box \" data-box-layout=\"slim\" data-box-position=\"below\" data-multiauthor=\"false\" data-author-id=\"1\" data-author-type=\"user\" data-author-archived=\"\">\n   <div class=\"m-a-box-container\">\n    <div class=\"m-a-box-tab m-a-box-content m-a-box-profile\" data-profile-layout=\"layout-1\" data-author-ref=\"user-1\" itemscope itemid=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n     <div class=\"m-a-box-content-middle\">\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-avatar\" data-source=\"local\">\n       <a class=\"m-a-box-avatar-url\" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-150 photo\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png 150w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-80x80.png 80w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-24x24.png 24w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-48x48.png 48w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-96x96.png 96w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-300x300.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" data-attachment-id=\"17663\" data-permalink=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/?attachment_id=17663\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\" data-orig-size=\"832,778\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Screen Shot 2021-09-14 at 9.02.24 AM\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\"></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-social \">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-facebook m-ico-\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MarkTechPost/\" target=\"_blank\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Facebook profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-facebook\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-twitter m-ico-\" href=\"https://twitter.com/asifrazzaq1988\" target=\"_blank\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Twitter profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-twitter\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-linkedin m-ico-\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/asifrazzaq/\" target=\"_blank\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Linkedin profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-linkedin\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-data\">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-name\">\n        <h5 itemprop=\"name\"><a class=\"m-a-box-name-url \" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemprop=\"url\"> Asif Razzaq</a></h5>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-meta\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-web\">Website</span></a>&nbsp;<span class=\"m-a-box-meta-divider\">|</span>&nbsp;<a href=\"#\" class=\"m-a-box-data-toggle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-more-posts\">+ posts</span></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-bio\" itemprop=\"description\">\n        <p>Asif Razzaq is the CEO of Marktechpost AI Media Inc.. As a visionary entrepreneur and engineer, Asif is committed to harnessing the potential of Artificial Intelligence for social good. His most recent endeavor is the launch of an Artificial Intelligence Media Platform, Marktechpost, which stands out for its in-depth coverage of machine learning and deep learning news that is both technically sound and easily understandable by a wide audience. The platform boasts of over 2 million monthly views, illustrating its popularity among audiences.</p>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-related\" data-related-layout=\"layout-1\"></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- CONTENT END 2 -->\n  <div class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_bottom  tdi_79 td_block_template_1\">\n   <!-- omni_parse_bench in-article 728x90 (terminal) | paste into a Custom HTML block | fills the article column and scales down on narrow screens -->\n   <div id=\"op728x90a\">\n    <a class=\"o\" href=\"https://aicampaign.live/omnipar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener\"><span class=\"tw\"><span class=\"tl1\"><span class=\"dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"pr\">$</span><span class=\"cmd\">uv pip install omni-parse-bench</span><span class=\"cur\"></span></span><span class=\"tl2\"><span class=\"ok k1\"><b>✓</b>text</span><span class=\"ok k2\"><b>✓</b>tables</span><span class=\"ok k3\"><b>✓</b>layout</span><span class=\"ok k4\">→ scored per page</span></span></span><span class=\"cta\"><span class=\"ct\">Star on GitHub</span><b class=\"ar\">→</b></span><span class=\"tag\">Sponsored</span></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Together AI 发布了 Together Compiler，这是一个由智能体驱动的系统，可持续重新优化推理，在 24 小时内实现比已发布的最佳 InferenceX 配置高出 2.6x 的 TPS。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Together AI 发布了 Together Compiler，这是一个由智能体驱动的系统，可持续重新优化推理，在 24 小时内实现比已发布的最佳 InferenceX 配置高出 2.6x 的 TPS。",
  "summary": "Together Compiler 是一个持续编译循环，利用编程智能体重写模型的前向传播，以优化推理性能。系统接收服务器启动命令、流量配置和硬件配置，随后由智能体提出更快的前向传播方案，并通过常驻引擎逐一测量。该系统在多种硬件上运行多个模型，包括 Kimi K3、GLM 5.3、MiniMax M3.1 Flash、DeepSeek v4.1 Flash 和 Llama 1B；硬件涵盖 NVIDIA B200、B300、GB300、H100、AMD MI355X 和 AWS Trainium2。测试显示，系统在 24 小时内实现了比已发布的最佳 InferenceX 配置高出 2.6x 的 TPS。与重启引擎的基线方案相比，支持热重载的常驻引擎将智能体实验吞吐量提高了 252x。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "持续编译循环",
      "explanation": "Together Compiler 利用编程智能体，随着生产流量变化持续重新优化推理，解决引擎经过一次调优后会随时间逐渐过时的问题。"
